title: "EU AI Act — Obligation-to-Evidence Dataset"
abstract: >-
  An open, machine-readable dataset mapping EU AI Act obligations to the specific
  evidence an auditor expects, together with applicable roles, risk tiers,
  deadlines, and common audit red flags. A practitioner reference; not legal advice.
